=2 Walkthrough
* Zone after finishing the previous quest to start talking to {n:Roskin}
* Talk to {n:Roskin} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (H-8)
* Trade {n:Roskin} some {i:Ulbuconut Milk|Ulbuconut Milk|5976}
** You can purchase {i:Ulbuconut Milk|Ulbuconut Milk|5976} from {n:Bernegeois} {z:Eastern Adoulin} (G-8) if that character has completed {q:Cafe...teria|Cafe...teria|Cafe...teria} during the current Conquest Tally.
* You will be tasked with gathering information from the following locations.
* {z:Eastern Adoulin}: {k:Copy of "Adoulin's Patroness"} and {k:Copy of "Wrath of the Land"} (Scout's Coalition, from both ??? points)
* {z:Eastern Adoulin}: {k:Copy of "Hallowed Wood"} from {p:Greebly} (G-6) for 2000 Bayld (SE of 'The Wharf to Yahse' waypoint)
* {z:Eastern Adoulin}: {k:Copy of "Shrouded in Enigma"} from {n:Amaury} (J-11) (SSW of 'Castle Adoulin Gates' waypoint)
* Celennia Memorial Library: {k:Giant sheep export record} (History) and {k:Copy of "The Verdancy"} (Geography)
** Requires having already completed the quest {q:Order Up|Order Up|Order Up}
* {z:Western Adoulin}: {k:Report of a sorcerous nation} from {n:Louisareaux} (F-8) (East of 'Pioneers' Coalition' waypoint)
* {z:Western Adoulin}: {k:Piece of a SCT Coalition report} from the fountain SE of 'Platea Triumphus' waypoint ({p:Fontis Xanira}, H-9). Note: if you keep listening in on the conversation, Palomel will repeat random things, some of which are clues to other locations.
** After obtaining {k:Piece of a SCT Coalition report} from the fountain, speak with {n:Wegellion} in Scouts' Coalition.
* {z:Rala Waterways}: {k:Adoulinian agricultural treatise} from {n:Sivalda} (F-11)
** Take the 'Your Rent-a-Room' waypoint in Western Adoulin and enter Rala Waterways from the J-12 entrance.
* {z:Rala Waterways}: {k:Dictum on colonization} and {k:Memo found in Rala Waterways} both from one ??? (NorthEast M-9).
** There is no quick way to get there, enter from Eastern Adoulin (F-7) and hoof it. Bring a form of sneak or fight your way through.
* {z:Foret de Hennetiel}: Head to the ??? (F-7) along the North shore to obtain {k:Cryptic memorandum}.
** After obtaining the Key Item Piece of a SCT Coalition report (above), you must speak to Wegellion in the Scouts' Coalition, and he will give you a clue to a key item in Foret de Hennetiel. You will be unable to get the memorandum until you do.
** Use Bivouac #4, head north to the castoff point at G-7, then choose Upstream.
** You may need to click the ??? more than once, as it can bestow several key items.
*** See the "Optional" section at the bottom of the page for how to use this memorandum to obtain some free Bayld.
* {z:Woh Gates}: Requires a {i:pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} to dig up {k:mystifying metal rod|Mystifying metal rod} from the ??? at F-8 (in a small room that may be reached from the North path).
** {z:Kamihr Drifts} Frontier Station then south into {z:Woh Gates}

* Once you've collected these things, return to Palomel in {z:Eastern Adoulin}, across from the entrance to the Scouts' Coalition. This opens up new options:
** Talk to Palomel again, you'll need to show the {k:Copy of "Hallowed Wood"} to her before the next step.
*** {n:Nhili Uvolep} at the Sverdhreid Hill waypoint in {z:Eastern Adoulin} can appraise your {k:Copy of "Hallowed Wood"}, replacing it with a {k:"Hallowed Wood" replica}. (She will not have anything to say if you attempt this before you've spoken to Palomel.)
** {n:Polished Pebble}, the galka in the hallway of the Inventor's Coalition, can refurbish your {k:mystifying metal rod|Mystifying metal rod} into a {k:rusty katana|Rusty katana}.
*** Talk to Palomel and ask about the katana, and it will transform into a {k:Traditional Adoulinian katana}.

* Afterwards, you can bring all the information to Roskin, who asks you to choose the most important items relating to the Great Expedition. After choosing which are most important, you receive 2000 XP and 1000 bayld.

* {k:Copy of "Wrath of the Land"} ~ Yes
* "Hallowed Wood" replica ~ No
* Copy of "Shrouded in Enigma" ~ No
* Copy of "Adoulin's Patroness" ~ No
* {k:Report of a sorcerous nation} ~ Yes
* {k:Copy of "The Verdancy"} ~ Yes
* {k:Giant sheep export record} ~ Yes
* {k:Dictum on colonization} ~ Yes
* Adoulinian agricultural treatise ~ No
* Traditional Adoulinian Katana ~ No

* Wait one game day and return to Roskin; he will reward you with another 5000 bayld for a perfect report or 2 bayld for one with mistakes.
** Zoning is required.

=3 Optional
* At {z:Rala Waterways} (N-10) there is a blank spot. You MUST have the KI {k:Memo found in Rala Waterways} before checking this spot, and upon completion you will lose the KI.
* Checking the blank spot presents a question: "What entity keeps the Sacred City safe?". Typing "ERGISADE", in all capital letters will reward the player with 10,000 bayld. At the time this quest was released, it was unknown what Ergisade was. See the Discussion page for notes on how this puzzle was solved.
* The next quest in this series has a cutscene with hints on solving the cipher, but you will see a shorter alternative version if you've already completed it.

